  "body_html": "<h1>restrictReachableSubgame_liftReachableSubgame</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\n@[simp] theorem restrictReachableSubgame_liftReachableSubgame {G : ExtensiveGame iota U} [(s : G.State) -&gt; Fintype (G.Action s)] {root : G.State} [(s : G.State) -&gt; Decidable (Arena.Reachable G.toArena root s)] (base : G.BehaviorProfile) (beta : (G.reachableSubgameAt root).BehaviorProfile) : (base.liftReachableSubgame beta).restrictReachableSubgame root = beta</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>BehaviorProfile</li>\n<li>reachableSubgameAt</li>\n<li>liftReachableSubgame</li>\n<li>restrictReachableSubgame</li>\n</ul>",
